  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5434c09f6cea43c2a33a8317df215dd3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Daily_Rules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Hamdoku::Hamdoku.L10NSO
  id: 925
  chinese: "每日开放一道挑战。\n普通完成获得 1 块拼图；无失误完成获得 2 块。\n同一天的拼图仅结算一次，完美升级只补差额。\n收集拼图可兑换本月限定服装，领取后在个人资料中穿戴。\n\n往期日期补签、再次挑战及失败重试需要广告授权，当前服务尚未接入。\n当前使用设备本地日期；云端校时、云存档和 TOP 排名尚未接入。"
  english: "One challenge opens each day.\nClear it for 1 puzzle piece, or clear without mistakes for 2.\nEach day awards pieces once; a perfect upgrade adds only the difference.\nRedeem pieces for this month’s outfits and equip them in Profile.\n\nMake-up days, retries and replays require ads, which are not connected yet.\nDates use the device clock. Cloud time, cloud saves and TOP rankings are not connected."
